00:14:28.300 --> 00:14:29.635
can you give us just like a,

00:14:29.635 --> 00:14:32.238 align:start size:84% position:16%
like a high level
version of that and,

00:14:32.238 --> 00:14:36.108 align:start position:0%
and sort of when did you
