00:14:47.720 --> 00:14:49.922 align:start size:97% position:3%
- Yeah, yeah.
- Bring a vaccine to market

00:14:51.290 --> 00:14:53.926 align:start size:94% position:6%
and that's typically
about a 10 year timeline.

00:14:55.361 --> 00:14:58.130
To illustrate the point,
the Department of Defense,

00:14:58.130 --> 00:15:00.900 align:start size:88% position:13%
