disease agents

00:15:09.275 --> 00:15:11.377 align:start size:81% position:19%
that were deployed
in bio warfare

00:15:11.377 --> 00:15:13.379
up until the end
of World War II.

00:15:13.379 --> 00:15:14.580
And if everything goes right,

00:15:14.580 --> 00:15:17.549 align:start size:84% position:16%
they'll have all those
