edge computational modeling.

00:23:07.886 --> 00:23:11.590 align:start size:97% position:3%
We screened the entire library
of all known licensed drugs

00:23:11.590 --> 00:23:13.925
as well as nutraceuticals.

00:23:13.925 --> 00:23:18.063
And we came up with a
ranked list of agents.

00:23:18.063 --> 00:23:22.601 align:start size:97% position:3%
And then I was at a drug
discovery conference involving

00:23:22.601 --> 00:23:26.972 align:start size:97% position:3%
artificial intelligence
and machine learning at MIT

00:23:26.972 --> 00:23:28.807
