background in pathology

00:24:04.609 --> 00:24:07.179
and working with a
very strong team,

00:24:10.182 --> 00:24:12.484
including other pathologists,

00:24:12.484 --> 00:24:14.986 align:start size:84% position:16%
I was of the belief
that this was,

00:24:14.986 --> 00:24:18.323
this was likely to be lethal.

00:24:18.323 --> 00:24:21.293
Or at a minimum to cause

00:24:21.293 --> 00:24:24.696 align:start size:94% position:6%
